<title>USA: Lawson corrects pay date for higher payout.</title>
<headline>Lawson corrects pay date for higher payout.</headline>
<dateline>DES PLAINES, Ill. 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lawson Products Inc said Tuesday it had raised its quarterly dividend and was correcting the pay date for the higher rate to October 14 from October 17 as originally stated.</p>
<p>The quarterly dividend had been raised on August 5 to $0.14 a share from $0.13.</p>
<p>The record date remains September 30.</p>
<p>		((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
